{"4116810":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Bald Busters","steam_appid":4116810,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/4adbdc38e8d661447cb955e36e0360ac.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=198 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the release of an &quot;Instant Muscle Pill,&quot; millions built massive physiques without setting foot in a gym... at the cost of every single hair on their heads. The result? An endless horde of jacked dudes whose shiny bald heads reflect so much sunlight that they are triggering a new Ice Age.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/a269f40dc1630445c518893b22abc9a8.poster.avif?t=1793699283\" width=772 height=550 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/a269f40dc1630445c518893b22abc9a8.webm?t=1793699283\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/a269f40dc1630445c518893b22abc9a8.mp4?t=1793699283\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the planet's sole hair expert, your mission is to hunt down, blast, and regrow hair on these beefcakes before we all freeze to death.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/68e319b446faf942c95450dd9c87d11a.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aggressive Hair Hunting:<\/strong> Fry bald heads gun in hand or deploy your barber squad to plant hair on them while they run along the beach.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follicular Destruction Arsenal:<\/strong> Obliterate them with Minoxidil blasts, micrograft guns, quantum lasers, and stem-cell bombs that will make them sweat hair.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/501283bca16dc5993f336ca61b5f0128.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Escalation:<\/strong> Glue on cheap toupees and advance to frantic mass transplants to stop the apocalypse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic Style &amp; Unfiltered Humor:<\/strong> Enjoy a beach vibe, panicking sweaty bald guys, and a &quot;heroic&quot; ending.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/418a880d712728ea9015a467170eb10b.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=198 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/4adbdc38e8d661447cb955e36e0360ac.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=198 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the release of an &quot;Instant Muscle Pill,&quot; millions built massive physiques without setting foot in a gym... at the cost of every single hair on their heads. The result? An endless horde of jacked dudes whose shiny bald heads reflect so much sunlight that they are triggering a new Ice Age.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/a269f40dc1630445c518893b22abc9a8.poster.avif?t=1793699283\" width=772 height=550 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/a269f40dc1630445c518893b22abc9a8.webm?t=1793699283\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/a269f40dc1630445c518893b22abc9a8.mp4?t=1793699283\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the planet's sole hair expert, your mission is to hunt down, blast, and regrow hair on these beefcakes before we all freeze to death.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/68e319b446faf942c95450dd9c87d11a.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aggressive Hair Hunting:<\/strong> Fry bald heads gun in hand or deploy your barber squad to plant hair on them while they run along the beach.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follicular Destruction Arsenal:<\/strong> Obliterate them with Minoxidil blasts, micrograft guns, quantum lasers, and stem-cell bombs that will make them sweat hair.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/501283bca16dc5993f336ca61b5f0128.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=270 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Escalation:<\/strong> Glue on cheap toupees and advance to frantic mass transplants to stop the apocalypse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic Style &amp; Unfiltered Humor:<\/strong> Enjoy a beach vibe, panicking sweaty bald guys, and a &quot;heroic&quot; ending.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/extras\/418a880d712728ea9015a467170eb10b.avif?t=1793699283\" width=780 height=198 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Bald men are driving Earth into a new Ice Age! Their shiny heads reflect solar light and disrupt the planet's albedo. Recruit barbers, blast Minoxidil, and regrow their hair before we all freeze to death!","supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German, Bulgarian, Czech, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Danish, Spanish - Latin America, Finnish, Greek, Dutch, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Catalan, Estonian, Basque, Galician","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116810\/c8f6ca0035fe21deb5f3bc2fb5d72adc3aa9f14e\/header.j